    "title": "Small airplane makes emergency landing at Highlands of Elgin golf course - NewsBreak",
    "text": "ELGIN, Ill. ( WGN ) – A small airplane had to make an emergency landing Wednesday evening on the Highlands of Elgin golf course after experiencing mechanical issues. The Elgin Fire Department said at around 8:20 p.m., the FAA notified the fire department that a small private plane was preparing to land due to mechanical trouble. Elgin firefighters and police officers were sent to the scene and found the plane had landed safely on the golf course. No injuries were reported. The NTSB has been notified of the incident and will be investigating. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WGN-TV.",
